Package: a-nas-assistant-trial
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: A-NAS <zhongwater123@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: a-nas (= @VERSION@), @CONTENT@, socat, ripgrep, tini
Description: the A-NAS assistant trial, for development testing only
 The scripts and units of the AI assistant's trial on the Experimental NAS
 (docs/runbooks/try-ai-assistant-on-experimental-nas.md), with a cloud
 model. It depends on a-nas at its own version, so the two always update
 together. nas-trial.sh install sets the trial up once the model's key is
 written; each upgrade then runs nas-trial.sh update. The formal assistant
 is the Host Agent's (docs/adr/0024).
